From c0a58d36be1e4bf3d868529e0cb6c2fc559dc781 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:57:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(2d): clear Zigzag rest boundaries without wall cusps

Add closing boundary passes and bound the row inset by the stepover.
Pin corner coverage, clean verification, safe rapids, and tiny-pocket rows.
Record the remaining stock-proof work in issues #2031, #2032, and #2033.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1490
